:: power
> fans@cbd81a23d91fceb42a25
  [A contactor closes. The lights hold. Fans gather speed beyond the partition; through the grille between the doors comes a knock that misses every third turn.]
-> END

:: plan
> shaft@cbd81a23d91fceb42a26
  [The paper opens along an old repair. It shows a stair south of the junction. N-2 is marked as a cable shaft. Neither chamber has a name.]
-> END
